rl":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118401","id":4232205636,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc78QlVE","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-12T18:04:28Z","updated_at":"2026-04-12T18:04:28Z","body":"> What's the binary size and performance/memory impact?\r\n\r\nMemory impact is mostly a wash and remains consistently similar across non-perfetto and perfetto builds.\r\n\r\nNote the attached `dumpsys meminfo` memory usages show the non-perfetto build having negligible higher memory usage but this fluctuates between runs of the same build; in general memory usages for both builds are similar within the margin of error.\r\n\r\n[Kenney 3D Platformer (Perfetto build) Applications Memory Usage (in Kilobytes).txt](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26661283/3D.Platformer.Perfetto.build.Applications.Memory.Usage.in.Kilobytes.txt)\r\n[Kenney 3D Platformer (Perfetto free build) Applications Memory Usage (in Kilobytes).txt](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26661284/3D.Platformer.Perfetto.free.build.Applications.Memory.Usage.in.Kilobytes.txt)\r\n","author_association":"CON